    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wi-Fi, not just internet, but your digital life partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced era, we are faced with cold screens and complicated work every day. The name \u201cWi-Fi\u201d brings to mind \u201cwireless network\u201d at first glance, but in this software, it represents another kind of connection:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witty Interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun, flexible and personalized desktop widget system that is not just a tool, but an expression of your mood and lifestyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm Interaction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop pets, elves, quote reminders, every interaction is a gentle reminder that \u201cyou're not alone in front of the computer.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pendant Fusion Interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fusion of various functional modules with the desktop to create a free combination of intelligent desktop environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wi + Fi = Wi Fang's Island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who are familiar with WiFi, this software is like a private WiFi digital micro-universe you build, full of creativity and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>",
